      "title_zh": "Meta 发布 30B 参数开源模型 Muse Glimmer 优化本地智能体工作流",
      "title_orig": "RT AI at Meta: Introducing Muse Glimmer, an open-weight 30B-parameter model optimized for local, always-on agent workflows. Muse Glimmer delivers stro...",
